==Battleground==
===<u>Chapters 1 & 2</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|B.B.Bunny|Those Guys|Squire Rel|Sir Seal|One Horn}}
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 25 seconds<sup>750f</sup>, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 5~16.67 seconds<sup>150f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 116.67 seconds<sup>3,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 170 seconds<sup>5,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.

===<u>Chapter 3</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|B.B.Bunny|Those Guys|Squire Rel|Sir Seal|Ginger Snache|One Horn}}
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 15 seconds<sup>450f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**8 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
**10 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~6 seconds<sup>90f~180f</sup>.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Just bring one or two [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red cats]] if necessary. [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] makes this stage a breeze.

